{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf2f <strong>Serve Turkey\u2019s Spiciest Wraps in Your Own Shop!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master of \u00c7i\u011fk\u00f6fte</strong> puts you in charge of a Turkish street food restaurant!<br>Wrap up pre-made \u00e7i\u011fk\u00f6fte, add sauces, drinks, and packaging \u2014 and keep customers happy! \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73\ud83e\udd64<br><br>\ud83e\uded3 <strong>Wrap &amp; Serve:</strong><br>Place \u00e7i\u011fk\u00f6fte in lava\u015f, drizzle sauces, add garnishes, pack with napkins and drinks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Buy Items Like Bags, Straws, Napkins:</strong><br>Each item helps you perfect your delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddca <strong>Unlock a Drink Fridge:</strong><br>Upgrade your menu with cold beverage options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Customize Your Shop:</strong><br>Change your wall &amp; counter designs, hang your own photo, and earn your business certificate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Unlock Functional Items:</strong><br>Earn money and unlock new systems like the <strong>scale (tart\u0131)</strong> for expanding your workflow \u2014 not for delivery, but for production efficiency!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb8 <strong>Pay Daily Rent:</strong><br>Manage your income wisely or risk losing it all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd2b <strong>Mysterious Visitors:</strong><br>Not every customer comes for food \u2014 choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>A vibrant, fast-paced first-person simulator full of Turkish flavor and charm!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698250?t=1746826763","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698250/56e09c91afbafe653f248670d5f36f3dd7c11a3d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746826763","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698250/5cef404693ebd0f35a3a2ee97021d3a06c9b71ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746826763","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698250/5cef404693ebd0f35a3a2ee97021d3a06c9b71ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746826763","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf2f <strong>Serve Turkey\u2019s Spiciest Wraps in Your Own Shop!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master of \u00c7i\u011fk\u00f6fte</strong> puts you in charge of a Turkish street food restaurant!<br>Wrap up pre-made \u00e7i\u011fk\u00f6fte, add sauces, drinks, and packaging \u2014 and keep customers happy! \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73\ud83e\udd64<br><br>\ud83e\uded3 <strong>Wrap &amp; Serve:</strong><br>Place \u00e7i\u011fk\u00f6fte in lava\u015f, drizzle sauces, add garnishes, pack with napkins and drinks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Buy Items Like Bags, Straws, Napkins:</strong><br>Each item helps you perfect your delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddca <strong>Unlock a Drink Fridge:</strong><br>Upgrade your menu with cold beverage options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Customize Your Shop:</strong><br>Change your wall &amp; counter designs, hang your own photo, and earn your business certificate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Unlock Functional Items:</strong><br>Earn money and unlock new systems like the <strong>scale (tart\u0131)</strong> for expanding your workflow \u2014 not for delivery, but for production efficiency!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb8 <strong>Pay Daily Rent:</strong><br>Manage your income wisely or risk losing it all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd2b <strong>Mysterious Visitors:</strong><br>Not every customer comes for food \u2014 choose wisely.</p>